  "details": "Many game systems, shaders, UIs, features and other aspects of worlds are built with first person view as a fundamental assumption and cannot support third person because they only make sense in first person view.\n\nBecause Third Person View is a departure from the norm for VRChat worlds, worlds should have to OPT-IN specifically to affirm that they are compatible with it.\n\nEDIT I know this has been indicated on the recent update, but I want to make extremely sure this option is available.",
